# Intentionally empty.
#
# `hardhat.config.js` points `paths.sources` here so that `npx hardhat compile` is a
# no-op. Foundry is the only compiler in this repo — the contracts live in
# `contracts/src/` and resolve OpenZeppelin through Foundry remappings.
#
# Hardhat exists for `@somnia-chain/markets-sdk` and `@somnia-chain/reactivity`, which
# are TypeScript packages. Do not put Solidity here.
